      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到这里时，除米浴之外的成员们\n都像察觉到了什么似的变了表情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16ef2491693824c5a757eac57d5dfd3558bc5e41116d43a5993c05562471d668",
