    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f021477baa8e38ec0c3e4d65",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴下次要参加的比赛……那是对所有赛马娘来说都很特别的，\n一生只能参加一次，来决出顶点的，那个比赛――",
      "source_fingerprint": "28d6eecec3cc5c07e87988779503218274c6d3629860482e35e85570f0bfd50c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002011.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65886150eb75a871459919c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且，她想着如果用自己的魔法，\n或许能把外面的世界变得更幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ee1954014f552b850c89a603be55e49a5df05c403c81ccdd26607c786987d09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
